# Private literals for deploy/scripts/check_repo_privacy.py: your own host
# names, domains, account names. Copy this file OUTSIDE the repository (or to
# the ignored .local/privacy-patterns) and point the scanner at it:
#   EVERGARDEN_PRIVACY_PATTERNS=~/private/evergarden-privacy-patterns
#   python deploy/scripts/check_repo_privacy.py --patterns <path>
# One literal per line; prefix a line with re: only when a regular expression
# is required. The scanner refuses a list inside the published tree and never
# prints the matched value.
private-handle
re:private[._-]account
